 head red he  basically had pieces of rubber glued to  his skin rubber is an insulator so  things got really hot plus vision wears  a skin-tight costume that doesn't  breathe well it's uncomfortable and it's  hard to stay cool the costume designers  added tubes inside the suit that could  pump ice water it helped to cool him off  some but it was still pretty miserable  he was advised to meditate or read when  he's not filming to distract himself  Paul said he would think about how lucky  he was and how many people would give  anything to have the role it definitely  helped him keep going not everyone got  the ice tube option though some costumes  were just too tight but we need to go  [Music]  danos isn't just a terrible villain he's  pretty much the worst dad ever he  adopted nebula and Gamora and turned  them against each other to let me live  and he literally tormented nebula by  replacing her body parts with one by one  that made nebulas costume extremely  challenging for makeup and costume  designers it took hours for Karen  Gilliam to get into her costume every  day and nebula has no hair for her first  contract Karen was required to shave her  head but Karen was known for her  beautiful red hair she revealed at  comic-con one year that she had gone  bald by taking off her wig Karen didn't  want to stay bald though and Marvel had  to have her back in her second contract  she made sure that shaving her head  wasn't required  this made the visual Department get  creative they did figure out a way to  make nebula look like nebula without  care and going bald Marvel fans know  that the red skull is one of the evilest  villains in the franchise we first meet  him in Captain America the First Avenger  he is a Nazi scientist whose own  experiment went awry he escapes into  space but we find out in the Avengers  infinity war that he got his due he  spends his days alone guarding the soul  stone as penance Hugo Weaving played Red  Skull in Captain America he and Marvel